msgstr ""
"O proceso de control de Akonadi informou en %1 de erros durante o arranque."

#: selftestdialog.cpp:537
msgid "No previous Akonadi control error log found."
msgstr "Non se achou ningún rexistro anterior de erros de Akonadi."

#: selftestdialog.cpp:538
msgid ""
"The Akonadi control process did not report any errors during its previous "
